        <item>
         <widget class="QLabel" name="starterPoolsHint">
          <property name="text"><string>Instead of writing a deck down, the mod may weight pools of its own and let the game draw a new deck from them ("starter_pools"). Each pool draws its own number of cards, and the draws must add up to forty. Unlike the disc's own rows, a pool may weight a card the mod adds. A written deck is dealt first, so these are read only when no deck is offered.</string></property>
          <property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property>
         </widget>
        </item>
